ay-timeline-generator.summary_text.when_should_the_cake_cutting_happen.614523be":"切蛋糕应该什么时候进行？","tools.wedding-day-timeline-generator.p_text.most_us_timelines_place_cake_cutting_abo.cad0cb09":"大多数美国时间安排在舞池开放后约 30 分钟进行切蛋糕，随后是祝酒和家长舞会。这也是摄影师的暗示，正式报道即将完成。","tools.wedding-day-timeline-generator.summary_text.how_far_in_advance_should_i_create_the_d.fc9c6bba":"我应该提前多久创建日期时间表？","tools.wedding-day-timeline-generator.p_text.two_to_four_weeks_before_the_wedding_onc.108090ed":"婚礼前两到四个星期，供应商到达时间和仪式细节得到确认后。至少在婚礼前一周与婚礼派对和所有供应商分享。","tools.wedding-day-timeline-generator.summary_text.can_i_give_this_to_my_vendors.8588ea10":"我可以把这个给我的供应商吗？","tools.wedding-day-timeline-generator.p_text.yes_copy_result_produces_plain_text_you.52e24b8c":"是的。复制结果生成纯文本，您可以将其粘贴到电子邮件中，而打印/PDF 则提供干净的供应商就绪表。指定除这对夫妇之外的一个重要人物，以确保这一天按计划进行。","tools.wedding-day-timeline-generator.summary_text.what_if_my_reception_is_at_a_different_v.92269d52":"如果我的接待处在不同的地点怎么办？","tools.wedding-day-timeline-generator.p_text.enable_the_20_minute_drive_option_travel.2bb1029e":"启用 20 分钟车程选项。旅行时间会消耗掉鸡尾酒时间，所以要么在仪式前延长鸡尾酒时间，要么移动家庭照片——该工具会在结果下方的注释中显示碰撞。","tools.wedding-day-timeline-generator.h2_text.more_free_wedding_tools.511ec8cc":"更多免费婚礼工具","tools.wedding-day-timeline-generator.a_text.budget_calculator.4a2217e0":"预算计算器","tools.wedding-day-timeline-generator.a_text.seating_chart.0aa1b5db":"座位表","tools.wedding-day-timeline-generator.a_text.hashtag_generator.f0d774ee":"话题标签生成器","tools.wedding-day-timeline-generator.a_text.invitation_maker.eaa060de":"请柬制作工具","tools.wedding-day-timeline-generator.a_text.save_the_date.f3ad2c82":"婚期预告","tools.wedding-day-timeline-generator.a_text.photo_book_planner.a9887dd0":"照片书策划师","tools.wedding-day-timeline-generator.a_text.photo_collage.942e207a":"照片拼贴","tools.wedding-day-timeline-generator.a_text.heic_to_jpg.67ca8d18":"HEIC 转 JPG","tools.wedding-day-timeline-generator.a_text.planning_checklist.8d9c7c04":"婚礼筹备清单","tools.wedding-day-timeline-generator.a_text.alcohol_calculator.aa6ed7fc":"酒水计算器","tools.weddi